Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's show up what we've got, Kaido? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole shebang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.14,0:00:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see how many survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you teleporting\Nthem downstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I could, I would have done it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their Haki is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get these two out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll do it by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.66,0:00:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes a big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope your stiff old joints\Nare still holding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you stretch?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stretch that skin\Noff your skull, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.78,0:01:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conquest of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell do you fight that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.64,0:01:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never dodge this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.36,0:02:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, Simmons!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.82,0:02:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.91,0:02:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear their voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're better than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.62,0:02:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Saru.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.18,0:02:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.94,0:02:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice job blocking that, even for a sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Straw Hat? Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.04,0:03:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red Hawk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.82,0:03:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it gonna hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.36,0:03:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo!
