Dialogue: 2,0:05:10.08,0:05:15.00,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(731,0)\t(689,731,\1a&H00&)}{Color of the Supreme King - OG}Conqueror's Haki{nao}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a pile of explosives here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.32,0:05:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I shall take them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.76,0:05:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The castle will burn to\Nthe ground at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.04,0:05:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And screw your new Onigashima\Nproject too, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.82,0:05:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this is your doing, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who crawled out\Nof their graves again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose you ghosts\Nare surprised to see me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:06:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly is your goal here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.22,0:06:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been 20 years and you still\Nwon't drop this blasted crusade!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hunted me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the way here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has your hate for me really\Nfueled you all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Orochi, it may be worth noting\Nthat they didn't witness your execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.95,0:06:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like you took quite a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.98,0:06:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that why you've come to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all half dead and you want\Nme to finish the job for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or did somebody hit your heads too\Nhard and now you've lost your minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step aside, Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't allow you to\Nwaste any more of our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what happens if I say no? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell you think you\Nare looking down on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:07:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the Shogun of the land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You exist by my grace alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop at me, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My actions have been\Njustified from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had every right to take\Nrevenge on the Kozuki clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had every right to take\Nwhat should have been mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think\Nyou're the heroes here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Citizens are supposed to\Nbow before their shogun,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not just from the peace Don't you\Nknow the meaning of authority?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower shuriken!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.70,0:07:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This country oppressed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It deserves what it gets!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.14,0:08:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That silent judgment almost did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the victim, don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop staring at me. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let them decide\Nyour punishment in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to avenge your lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems you have some integrity after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though he was a fool, you\Nstayed loyal to him till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ironic hearing that\Nfrom you of all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you and I are destined to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need vengeance as an excuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree, Race? Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.10,0:08:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:09:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me, Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back it up, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.08,0:09:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take you all on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.74,0:09:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.74,0:09:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:09:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parker, a free world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.76,0:10:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to take out the crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's done. My turn. Now, roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shambles!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you do it, Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go back to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:10:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flame red!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:10:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crossing the Six Paths!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.56,0:11:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop the violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding, innocent guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bobo, help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.78,0:11:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Punk pistol, no! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thought you could win if\Nyou took my homies away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.18,0:11:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.38,0:11:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't push it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.60,0:11:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In tact!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.90,0:11:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you'll beat me\Nby hitting me with a rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:12:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's no one to catch\Nher, then that's one down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.70,0:12:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.90,0:12:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me, Zos, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.58,0:12:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.82,0:12:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait one second, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.82,0:12:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is he standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That attack probably\Nbroke half of his bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pathetic, Linlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:12:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I gotta do this job on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tyrant Hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.74,0:13:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.38,0:13:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for shambles!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.44,0:13:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Injection shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.62,0:13:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you did,\Nbut I don't like it one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.36,0:13:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anti-bacterial cart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.74,0:13:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.66,0:13:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull it together, Drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:13:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fire thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna save Big Mom if\Nwe don't do something quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter. Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want one of us to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather have the mission fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.72,0:14:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we had to do was tear\NBig Mom and Kaido apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've come far enough. No\Nneed to throw your lives away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.16,0:14:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of Big Mom for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.14,0:14:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sure was a close one, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.44,0:14:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my sweet, adorable Prometheus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:14:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.06,0:15:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But somebody didn't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zeus, where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That useless idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.96,0:15:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pity he really let you\Ndown, didn't he? You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rely on that lazy chunk to\Ndo anything if you ask me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.68,0:15:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose I could ask for a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you believe that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cold stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.52,0:15:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:16:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though he's unconscious,\Nthe voice still glared at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got something you want\Nto say, you little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.22,0:16:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't get up soon, I'm gonna\Nsmash those eyeballs right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then the rest of your skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.26,0:16:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.36,0:16:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your heart, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.32,0:16:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Traffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got one good move left in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.46,0:16:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's going to push me to the limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything less than my\Nbest wouldn't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.62,0:16:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would just wear me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either this attack works or I'd die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's just my time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.14,0:16:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is it for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a duty to protect my captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to smash your head in that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try mine first, if you think you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon order!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine swords die out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.60,0:17:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ashura!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.60,0:17:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blades drawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.24,0:17:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine swords dialed!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.07,0:18:17.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(0,0)\p1\c&H000000&}m 174 19 l 1779 19 1779 1078 174 1078
Dialogue: 2,0:18:14.07,0:18:17.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an5\fnDry Brush\bord0\fscx1225\fscy1000\pos(960,250)\blur0.8\c&HFAFAFA&}ASURA
Dialogue: 2,0:18:14.07,0:18:17.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an5\fnDry Brush\bord0\fscx1000\fscy1000\pos(965,555)\blur0.8\c&HFAFAFA&}BLADES
Dialogue: 2,0:18:14.07,0:18:17.83,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an5\fnDry Brush\bord0\fscx1000\fscy1000\pos(930,875)\blur0.8\c&HFAFAFA&}DRAWN
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ashura, blade drawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dead man's game?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.83,0:18:21.04,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(0,0)\p1\c&H000000&}m 10 19 l 1779 19 1779 1078 174 1078
Dialogue: 2,0:18:17.83,0:18:21.04,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an5\fnDry Brush\bord0\fscx900\fscy1225\blur0.8\c&HF8F8FD&\pos(960,325)}DEAD MAN'S
Dialogue: 2,0:18:17.83,0:18:21.04,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2\an5\fnDry Brush\bord0\fscx2000\fscy1750\blur0.8\c&HF8F8FD&\pos(945,793.2)}GAME
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.90,0:18:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cut me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.42,0:19:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This breath? So you have it as\Nwell—that was conquerors Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.82,0:19:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah you think that\Nmeans something to me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whatever you call it\Nit still wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was all my strength and\Nyou barely even flinched.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you'd fall\Nto your knees, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you should be proud, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've given me a scar\Nthat will never fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your generation has\Ncertainly earned its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, run! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:19:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save yourself the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come to you. Thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.78,0:20:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bawwa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.70,0:20:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a damn shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'd join me, we could have\Nconquered the world together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.12,0:20:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we'd joined you, why the\Nhell would we ever join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll do anything to help the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kick your ass, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.72,0:20:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to repeat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.74,0:21:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll kick my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.32,0:21:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, go ahead and try it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.40,0:21:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the type to think\Nbefore you punch, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you've got something left, show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to pull back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.72,0:21:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haki, as you call it,\Ncoats your entire body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can be used as invisible\Narmor or as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, when you push beyond its limits,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your Haki doesn't simply\Nfortify your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.30,0:21:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It penetrates the enemy's body\Nand destroys it from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.44,0:21:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't strain yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the Haki flow to your fist from\Nthe parts that aren't using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.20,0:22:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last time, it was too shallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.24,0:22:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the midst of danger is\Nwhen true power blooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.04,0:22:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I figured it out when\Nyou attacked with your club.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.56,0:22:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can infuse things\Nwith Conqueror's Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.70,0:22:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How exactly will knowing that help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can do it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.36,0:22:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the privilege of\Nthe strong. A dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.34,0:22:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,walking like you couldn't\Ndream of it i'll show you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.48,0:23:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.16,0:23:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't overstress yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.40,0:24:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the Haki flow through your fist\Nfrom the parts that aren't using it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.48,0:24:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't even touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.26,0:25:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.78,0:25:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Traffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.69,0:25:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for protecting\Nme, but I'm good now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.28,0:25:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two should head downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.04,0:25:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.96,0:25:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.36,0:25:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone else.
